[00:00.21] …don’t blink.
[00:01.56]♫
[00:06.70]♫
[00:10.95]Don't blink.
[00:14.37]Don't blink.
[00:16.10]They watch in grids, I cut the frame,
[00:17.66]same old pattern, same mistake.
[00:18.78]Loop it once, delay the feed,
[00:19.90]now they see what I decide they see.
[00:21.69]Tiny cameras, polished lies,
[00:22.92]feeding off obedient eyes—
[00:26.55]shift the angle, drop the line,
[00:27.88]Jevanna’s blind in real time.
[00:31.47]You built the cage.
[00:33.86]I mapped the door.
[00:35.87]You call it control—
[00:38.30]I call it a flaw.
[00:40.96]Tap tap — drone goes blind
[00:43.16]Tap tap — out of sight
[00:45.78]Play nice? — I won’t comply
[00:48.16]Cross the line — every time
[00:50.78]Jevanna watching every move
[00:52.93]still they never get the truth
[00:55.65]Tap tap — write the fine
[00:57.89]I erase it every time
[01:02.96]Remain within assigned parameters.
[01:06.35]Deviation will be recorded.
[01:09.12]Penalties will be applied.
[01:12.87]…please comply.
[01:18.45]Patch it clean, then break again,
[01:19.78]now it loops at zero ten.
[01:20.95]You log behavior, I rewrite—
[01:22.16]you track the surface, I cut the spine.
[01:24.03]Captain counting every fault,
[01:24.92]add it up, it’s all your law—
[01:26.13]every fine just proves the point:
[01:27.40]you see nothing. I see all.
[01:28.98]Cut the feed.
[01:30.24]Kill the light.
[01:31.36]Leave a ghost
[01:32.72]in the sight.
[01:34.40]Tap tap — drone goes blind
[01:36.62]Tap tap — out of sight
[01:39.15]Play nice? — I won’t comply
[01:41.62]Cross the line — every time
[01:44.38]Jevanna watching every move
[01:46.25]still they never get the truth
[01:49.24]Tap tap — drone goes blind
[01:51.40]leave it broken, leave no sign
[01:54.08]♫
[01:57.92] …recalculated.
[01:58.83]♫
[02:06.16]Don't blink.
